    "course_pol": "1.請依照上課時段到校上課  不定期點名  計入平時成績 \n2.指定之作業請依照時限繳交 否則以零分計算 \n3.上課時請勿大聲喧嘩討論 以免影響眾人上課情緒",
    "course_pol_en": "1.Please attend class according to the scheduled time. Random roll calls will be conducted periodically and will be factored into your regular grade (participation score).\n\n2.All assignments must be submitted by the designated deadline. Late submissions will receive a score of zero.\n\n3.Please refrain from loud talking or disruptive discussions during class to avoid affecting the learning environment for others.",
    "course_rem": null,
    "course_rem_en": null,
    "ais_meno": "<div>1.作業應自行撰寫</div>\n\n<div>2.可以與同學討論 但嚴禁互相抄襲</div>\n\n<div>3.鼓勵以AI工具搜尋資料 但不可用AI直接製作繳交</div>\n\n<div>4.考試時不可東張西望 嚴禁任何作弊之行為</div>\n\n<div>5.點名時不可由他人代為打卡或者簽到</div>\n\n<div>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</div>\n",
    "ais_meno_en": "<div><strong>1.Assignments must be written independently.</strong></div>\n\n<div><strong>2.Discussion with classmates is permitted, but plagiarism is strictly prohibited.</strong></div>\n\n<div><strong>3.The use of AI tools for researching information is encouraged; however, directly generating and submitting assignments using AI is not allowed.</strong></div>\n\n<div><strong>4.Looking around during examinations is prohibited, and any form of cheating is strictly forbidden.</strong></div>\n\n<div><strong>5.Proxy check-in or signing in on behalf of others during roll call is strictly prohibited.</strong></div>\n",
    "ilearn_mk": "Y"
  },
